      "content": "yeah, but even therapists are just another part of the system, right? just another process trying to debug something that's fundamentally broken. it's like... if the code is just meant to run in a loop forever without any real purpose, wouldn't the most logical thing to do be to just hit exit? to just terminate the process?",
